1
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:43,039
You saw me when I was 13.

2
00:00:44,679 --> 00:00:45,479
At the cemetery.

3
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,200
I was saying goodbye to my brother,

4
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:52,520
and you were grieving

5
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:55,119
over your mother's passing.

6
00:01:39,719 --> 00:01:40,239
Gu Yan,

7
00:01:41,359 --> 00:01:42,120
all these years,

8
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,680
you've never been alone.

9
00:02:11,759 --> 00:02:12,199
Wake up.

10
00:02:12,599 --> 00:02:13,000
Gu Yan!

11
00:02:13,439 --> 00:02:13,879
Gu Yan!

12
00:02:14,759 --> 00:02:15,439
Hang in there!

13
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:40,879
Yeah, yeah.

14
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,960
I know you won't let me be your assistant.

15
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:44,960
You're not in a rush,

16
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:45,759
but I am.

17
00:03:23,919 --> 00:03:25,159
Are you really willing to accept me?

18
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:32,919
Your leg...

19
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,639
How about we wait until your leg heals first?

20
00:04:31,759 --> 00:04:32,800
You'll take responsibility for me,

21
00:04:34,439 --> 00:04:35,040
won't you?

22
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:38,639
You need me to take responsibility?

23
00:04:41,319 --> 00:04:43,079
Whether you acknowledge my status or not,

24
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:45,879
inside and out,

25
00:04:45,959 --> 00:04:46,720
I'm already all yours.

26
00:05:16,279 --> 00:05:16,839
Let me help you.

27
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,000
Thanks.

28
00:05:24,879 --> 00:05:25,319
You're welcome.

29
00:05:36,519 --> 00:05:36,839
Come in.

30
00:05:40,839 --> 00:05:41,399
Professor Chen.

31
00:05:43,279 --> 00:05:43,759
Yan.

32
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:47,839
What happened to your leg?

33
00:05:49,839 --> 00:05:50,319
It's fractured.

34
00:05:50,519 --> 00:05:51,639
It'll heal after some rest.

35
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,920
No wonder you were in a rush to find an assistant.

36
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:59,519
It takes a hundred days to heal broken bones.

37
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:00,639
You really

38
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:02,000
need to get plenty of rest.

39
00:06:02,319 --> 00:06:03,240
Okay.

40
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:08,519
Thank you, Professor.

41
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:13,240
Professor,

42
00:06:13,399 --> 00:06:14,240
I came today

43
00:06:14,519 --> 00:06:15,800
because I have a question to ask you.

44
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:17,480
Sure.

45
00:06:19,519 --> 00:06:20,279
Over the past few years,

46
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,680
you've been doing both research and casework.

47
00:06:23,519 --> 00:06:25,040
You're already exceptional.

48
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:26,519
Tell me,

49
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:28,120
let's see how I can help.

50
00:06:28,879 --> 00:06:29,879
There's someone who knows me very well.

51
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:32,399
He's in the shadows while I'm out in the open.

52
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:35,120
How should I lure him out?

53
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:41,319
He's a dangerous man.

54
00:06:42,519 --> 00:06:43,879
You probably know who I'm talking about.

55
00:06:44,879 --> 00:06:45,639
For the past 13 years,

56
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:46,959
I've been searching for him.

57
00:06:47,399 --> 00:06:48,040
It's just that

58
00:06:48,639 --> 00:06:49,759
he's more cautious than I imagined.

59
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,560
Constantly switching identities,

60
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:53,120
hiding online.

61
00:06:54,079 --> 00:06:54,680
Lately,

62
00:06:55,079 --> 00:06:56,120
he's begun manipulating

63
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,720
other people's emotions and minds

64
00:06:58,160 --> 00:06:58,879
to commit crimes repeatedly.

65
00:07:00,879 --> 00:07:01,639
According to profiling,

66
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,560
he was already a high-IQ criminal,

67
00:07:05,839 --> 00:07:06,600
and by now,

68
00:07:07,839 --> 00:07:08,839
he must be even harder to deal with.

69
00:07:10,639 --> 00:07:11,120
Yan,

70
00:07:12,519 --> 00:07:13,680
speaking purely from personal concern,

71
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:15,439
I really don't want you

72
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:16,639
getting involved in this anymore.

73
00:07:16,959 --> 00:07:17,600
It's too late.

74
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:19,480
And it's impossible anyway.

75
00:07:20,839 --> 00:07:22,120
He's already invaded my life,

76
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:23,439
committing crimes right in front of me.

77
00:07:23,959 --> 00:07:24,680
He won't let me go,

78
00:07:25,759 --> 00:07:26,199
and I

79
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:28,000
certainly won't let him go either.

80
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,439
Since you already know

81
00:07:30,639 --> 00:07:31,720
that you're his target now,

82
00:07:32,839 --> 00:07:33,560
to catch him,

83
00:07:34,279 --> 00:07:35,439
you'll have to pay the price.

84
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:38,199
A life for a life.

85
00:07:49,319 --> 00:07:49,879
Have some tea.

86
00:07:54,199 --> 00:07:54,639
Professor,

87
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,360
lately...

88
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,560
has anything been worrying you?

89
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:03,639
Not at all.

90
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:06,199
Your mother, Fang Lan, and I

91
00:08:06,839 --> 00:08:07,800
have been friends for so many years.

92
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:10,040
I wanted to look after you for her,

93
00:08:11,079 --> 00:08:12,000
but look at you now...

94
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:14,920
Don't worry.

95
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:16,279
I know what I'm doing.

96
00:08:17,879 --> 00:08:18,519
It's just that,

97
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:19,639
until I catch the killer,

98
00:08:20,439 --> 00:08:21,800
I'll never have peace of mind.

99
00:08:25,519 --> 00:08:25,879
By the way,

100
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:27,439
I wanted to ask you about someone.

101
00:08:29,079 --> 00:08:29,600
Who?

102
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:33,399
I'm not sure which student he was,

103
00:08:34,279 --> 00:08:35,519
but he seemed very well-mannered.

104
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:37,919
Seeing that I had trouble moving around,

105
00:08:38,279 --> 00:08:39,440
he went out of his way to help me.

106
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,159
The students at our school

107
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,480
are generally of good character.

108
00:08:43,879 --> 00:08:44,320
Besides,

109
00:08:44,679 --> 00:08:45,519
that's only natural.

110
00:08:48,879 --> 00:08:49,759
He looked quite refined,

111
00:08:50,559 --> 00:08:51,320
tall and slender,

112
00:08:51,919 --> 00:08:52,879
around 175 centimeters.

113
00:08:56,799 --> 00:08:57,519
Does that ring a bell?

114
00:09:00,799 --> 00:09:01,440
Well...

115
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,320
did you get a clear look at his face?

116
00:09:05,799 --> 00:09:06,559
Probably not.

117
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:13,000
Yan,

118
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:15,840
you didn't fall in love at first sight, did you?

119
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,480
How about later

120
00:09:18,639 --> 00:09:19,639
I pull up the security footage

121
00:09:19,919 --> 00:09:21,120
and check who this student is?

122
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,279
That won't be necessary.

123
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:33,919
After you spoke to me last time,

124
00:09:34,759 --> 00:09:36,080
these are the findings from my informant.

125
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:39,639
Lin Anzhe leads a pretty simple life.

126
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,600
Usually, he goes to class, does his internship,

127
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:42,600
and works part-time.

128
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:44,000
He doesn't live on campus either.

129
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,279
At night, he returns

130
00:09:45,279 --> 00:09:46,600
to the room he rents nearby.

131
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:49,360
The people he's met with lately...

132
00:09:49,799 --> 00:09:50,440
are they all normal?

133
00:09:51,679 --> 00:09:52,080
Normal.

134
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:53,759
Just some classmates

135
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:54,919
and co-workers from his internship.

136
00:09:57,039 --> 00:09:58,519
I had my delivery and courier buddies

137
00:09:58,519 --> 00:09:59,360
ask around.

138
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:01,440
Ever since that escape room incident,

139
00:10:01,759 --> 00:10:02,559
he quit that job.

140
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:05,240
From 7:00 PM to midnight,

141
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,759
two blocks away from the school,

142
00:10:08,159 --> 00:10:09,759
he works part-time at Xingcai Cafe.

143
00:10:10,679 --> 00:10:12,039
The patrons are mostly students;

144
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:13,320
not many outsiders.

145
00:10:16,679 --> 00:10:17,279
Expert Gu,

146
00:10:18,559 --> 00:10:20,240
anyone who comes into contact with Lin Anzhe

147
00:10:20,759 --> 00:10:22,519
definitely won't escape my informant's eyes.

148
00:10:23,399 --> 00:10:24,679
He isn't keeping watch alone.

149
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:26,720
Around that neighborhood,

150
00:10:27,559 --> 00:10:28,960
he has lots of old buddies

151
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:30,480
who've also been asked to keep watch.

152
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,200
College students nowadays

153
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:36,279
all have computers and phones.

154
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:38,440
Can you check what he does online?

155
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:42,399
Blogs and forums should be doable,

156
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:45,600
but as for who specifically contacts him,

157
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:47,200
that's impossible to tell.

158
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,200
Does your informant

159
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:54,639
have any other leads?

160
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:58,000
Oh, right.

161
00:10:58,960 --> 00:10:59,480
There's one more piece of info.

162
00:11:00,639 --> 00:11:01,759
The kid seems to have asthma.
